      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat already drops unloaded scenes completely from memory. This is built into Unity and just kind of how it works. We pay pretty close attention to how well we unload scenes between loads and we've not really seen this as an issue.\n\nDo you have any way to show that you're seeing GC failures?",
      "viewerReactions": null
